<InteriorLayout title="Project information — OhWP Studios" description="How initial scopes, project agreements, and trading technology engagements are approached at OhWP Studios."><main id="main"><section class="interior-mast"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Studio information / Working terms</p><h1>Clear expectations.<br /><em>A sound beginning.</em></h1><p class="lede">A conversation starts the work. A project-specific agreement defines it.</p></div></section><section class="wrap section-space editorial-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Before a project begins</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact">Discuss your project ↗</a></div><div class="editorial-copy"><h2>From scope to agreement.</h2><p>Website descriptions and automated estimates are initial planning information. They do not reserve delivery dates or establish a fixed price. We review the requirements and agree deliverables, responsibilities, milestones, pricing, payment, ownership, and support in a project-specific proposal or agreement before starting work.</p><p>Estimator amounts are displayed in USD. Any Ghana cedi quote is agreed separately. A guided build’s scope and level of support are also agreed for that engagement.</p><h2>Trading technology.</h2><p>Bots, indicators, alerts, and analysis tools implement an agreed set of rules. Testing results do not guarantee future returns. Strategy validation, forward testing, risk controls, and approval before any use with live capital are part of the project discussion. We do not build martingale or grid systems.</p><h2>Respect the work.</h2><p>Public source-code repositories carry their own licences. Client deliverables, source ownership, and permitted use are determined by the relevant project agreement. Please keep credentials and confidential client data out of public enquiry forms.</p><p>For questions about these pages or a proposed engagement, email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:ohwpstudios@gmail.com">ohwpstudios@gmail.com ↗</a>.</p></div></section></main></InteriorLayout>
